# Preferred V25 overlay. Apply after the combined V12..V24 candidate has
# materialized V22 ConversationSegment.inflight_fp / inflight_started_at and its
# strict mark-provider-intent method.
#
# Safety rule: unresolved provider outcome evidence is not ordinary cache/state.
# It must not disappear through the 30-day conversation TTL or
# MAX_CONVERSATIONS eviction. Capacity exhaustion is fail-closed only when a
# genuinely NEW intent would be created; exact replay and an already-existing
# ambiguous intent remain readable at the capacity limit.

